<section class="section">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="card">
      <span class="step-num">1</span>
      <h3>Connect Claude</h3>
      <p>Copy your personal connector URL from <strong>Settings → Connect Claude</strong> and add it to Claude as a custom connector.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <span class="step-num">2</span>
      <h3>“Log these receipts”</h3>
      <p>Send Claude your photos. It reads them and creates a draft claim. Spendwise flags anything over limit, missing a GSTIN, on a weekend or a likely duplicate.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <span class="step-num">3</span>
      <h3>Approve &amp; export</h3>
      <p>Your manager approves line by line. Finance marks it paid and exports a CSV for Tally, Zoho Books or Xero.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

